WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:03.966
Good morning!

2
00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:06.863
Who are you?

3
00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:11.168
I'm a Galapagos tortoise.

4
00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:16.396
We are the biggest tortoises in the world.

5
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.954
Where do you live?

6
00:00:21.136 --> 00:00:24.569
We live in the Galapagos Islands.

7
00:00:25.618 --> 00:00:29.242
These islands are in the Pacific Ocean.

8
00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:32.992
What do you eat?

9
00:00:33.548 --> 00:00:37.709
We eat grass, leaves, and cactus.

10
00:00:38.572 --> 00:00:41.016
We have no teeth.

11
00:00:42.761 --> 00:00:50.258
But we can bite food with our mouths.

12
00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:54.958
You have really thick legs!

13
00:00:55.922 --> 00:01:04.289
Yes. Our strong legs hold up our bodies.

14
00:01:05.138 --> 00:01:08.846
Our shells are very heavy!

15
00:01:10.685 --> 00:01:13.620
You're a good swimmer, right?

16
00:01:14.526 --> 00:01:16.541
Not really.

17
00:01:17.046 --> 00:01:22.309
Unlike turtles, tortoises mostly stay on land.

18
00:01:22.974 --> 00:01:26.882
We like to bask in the sun.

19
00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:31.440
Who are your enemies?

20
00:01:32.268 --> 00:01:37.859
Some humans hunt us, but most protect us.

21
00:01:39.158 --> 00:01:42.926
A few animals eat our eggs and babies.

22
00:01:43.997 --> 00:01:47.575
We can hide in our shells for protection.

23
00:01:48.803 --> 00:01:51.331
How old are you?

24
00:01:51.719 --> 00:01:55.279
I'm 95 years old.

25
00:01:56.268 --> 00:02:00.189
We live for a really long time.

26
00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:04.621
I'm going to bask in the sun now.

27
00:02:05.921 --> 00:02:07.857
Good-bye!

28
00:02:09.259 --> 00:02:14.017
Good-bye, Galapagos Tortoise!

